    "detailed_description": "<strong>Sail a steamboat and movecargo for profit</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cargo</strong></h2>Cargo can be bought and sold at different ports for money. Some places are illegal to move cargo between but give a higher resale value. Be carefull tho because the customs enforcers may seize your cargo if they catch you.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong></h2>Your steamboat can be upgraded at any shipwright in the world. Things such as the cargo hold and speed can be increased for money;<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Sailing<br></li><li>Openworld<br></li><li>Economy<br></li><li>Upgrades</li></ul>",
